Lets a custom vector source take MapLibre Tiles as well as MVT, so a host
that tiles its own data can deliver MLT bytes per tile. The tile decodes them
with the map's FastPFOR option, as a vector source with "encoding": "mlt" does
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/584).
Upstream: not proposed

